<pre class="code">
<span class="kw">void</span> cera_stats_box_time(cera_task_t *t, <span class="kw">long</span> ns);
</pre>
<p>The shims emitted by the generator call the first of these around
every box run when CERA_STATS is defined; the engine calls the
rest from the delivery path. All of them are cheap atomics on the
station's own counters; all of the <em>timing</em> callers compile out
without the define.</p>
