<pre class="code">
<span class="kw">void</span> cera_map_observe_start(cera_map_t *m, <span class="kw">const</span> <span class="kw">char</span> *path, <span class="kw">int</span> interval_ms);
</pre>
<p>Periodic emission of both reports to a file, from a small thread
